      {
        "Id": "dfa79645a825442d911c6abb34174757",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE:  slabs carry the building name in Mark (A, B, 1A, CUDDLES ..; blank = BUILDING).  Rooms named STAIR, LIFT, PARKING, RAMP, SHAFT, DUCT, DG, PUMP, SUBSTATION, FIRE CONTROL, REFUGE, STP .. are deducted from FAR.  Enter the plot area, RUN = False and run = preview (report only), then RUN = True: area plans per level in the SD schemes, the statement on sheet FAR-01 and an Excel next to the model.  Areas in sq ft, sqm in brackets.  Run again = replaced.  Ctrl+Z undoes a run.",
        "DescriptionText": "",
        "IsExpanded": true,
        "WidthAdjustment": 0.0,
        "HeightAdjustment": 0.0,
